Usage of deliver:
  -backend string
    	required for legacy plans: mock, haiku (paid), or named provider
  -budget float
    	alias for --call-budget (per call, not graph-wide) (default 0.25)
  -call-budget float
    	budget USD per call, not a graph-wide hard cap (default 0.25)
  -check string
    	acceptance argv as JSON; runs in delivery directory
  -check-timeout duration
    	acceptance deadline (default 1m0s)
  -dir string
    	delivery directory
  -executor string
    	how workers are launched: herdr or local or tmux (default: the run's recorded executor, then IRRIGATOR_EXECUTOR, then local)
  -field string
    	result field containing a JSON path-to-content map (default "files")
  -nodes string
    	comma-separated verified nodes to assemble
  -recheck
    	explicitly rerun failed or interrupted acceptance
  -run string
    	durable run directory; matching runs resume
  -timeout duration
    	timeout per call (default 2m0s)
  -workers int
    	maximum concurrent workers (default 2)
